=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  ports firewalld ----------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. web-01.example.net listens on 22, 80$
# and 443 on every address, 5353/udp, 5432 on loopback alone,$
# 9090 and 9100. firewalld is running, its zone public letting$
# in the same ports, and its zone internal 9090 from$
# 192.0.2.0/24 alone. The same Ports section, after firewalld's,$
# with a port let in from some sources.$
$
# Firewall Configuration #######################################$
$
  [+] Firewall             + firewalld running$
$
  firewalld ----------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] Installed            Yes$
  [+] Running              Yes$
  [+] At boot              Yes$
   -  Default zone         public$
   -  Active zones         internal, public$
$
  Ports --------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  22/tcp               Open sshd$
   -  80/tcp               Open nginx$
   -  443/tcp              Open nginx$
   -  5353/udp             Blocked avahi-daemon$
   -  5432/tcp             Local only postgres$
  [ ] 8080/tcp             Open nothing listening$
   -  9090/tcp             Some sources prometheus$
   -  9100/tcp             Blocked node_exporter$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Disable firewalld    Stop firewalld (not recommended)$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-1 or q]:$
$
$

